Research Assignment 1: Natural Language Processing (NLP)

1. Understanding Natural Language Processing
Natural Language Processing (NLP) is a technology that allows computers to communicate with humans through written and spoken language.
It is connected to three important fields:
Artificial Intelligence (AI): Gives computers the ability to perform intelligent activities.
Machine Learning (ML): Helps computers learn from information and experience.
NLP: Applies these technologies to human languages.
Practical example: When someone speaks to Siri, NLP interprets the spoken request, ML helps recognise language patterns, and AI helps produce an appropriate response.


